This was carved from shina plywood and printed by hand on kitakata and Wenzhou paper, using black and burnt umber ink.

The inspiration comes from the [Reptiles episode of the BBC Life nature documentary](https://www.bbc.co.uk/iplayer/episode/b00nj6dr/life-series-1-2-reptiles-and-amphibians) series, which includes footage of komodo dragons hunting a water buffalo.

I tested out and transferred the design using a papercut.

